## 6. Derivative and Improved Versions

A person who significantly improves DevHayat may publish and maintain their own modified version.

Such a version must:

1. Clearly state that it is derived from DevHayat.
2. Preserve the original copyright notice.
3. Preserve attribution to Parham Hayat.
4. Clearly distinguish the modified version from the original DevHayat project.
5. Not falsely claim that the original DevHayat project was created by the modifier.

An improved version does not automatically transfer ownership of the original DevHayat code.

